      "trackName": "Cookie Crush Watch Game",
      "description": "Cookie Crush Watch Game is a delicious Match-3 puzzle built for quick play on your wrist!\n\nSwap tasty cookies, clear bakery obstacles, and solve fun puzzle levels on the go.\n\nHOW TO PLAY:\n\nMatch 3 Cookies: Swap adjacent cookies to line up 3 of the same baked treats to clear them.\nMake Combos: Match 4 or 5 cookies to trigger special bakery bombs and clearing effects.\nBeat Levels: Clear target cookies and obstacles before running out of moves.\nUse Boosters: Use power-ups to blast through tough spots and hard lines.\nFEATURES:\n\nFast and fun Match-3 gameplay built for your wrist.\nVibrant bakery graphics and smooth animations.\nHundreds of tasty puzzle stages.\nPerfect for quick casual breaks offline.\nDownload Cookie Crush Watch Game today and start matching cookies on your wrist!",
